From 4ab78598f534b72b392ee1bdb627fa278f2636f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ahmed asif rashid <asif.rashid@carrybee.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 08:12:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tracker: match the demo layout (live data only)

Rebuilds the Tracker page to the demo's structure (carrybee-complete-web.html, pTracker):
- page head, KPI strip (Open, Unpicked, Awaiting 1st response, Past SLA)
- chip row with live counts; More views menu for CTG, Pick failures and Board
- queue of demo cards (priority and status pills, ID, merchant, meta, progress, owner initials, Open)
- right column: At a glance, Open by zone, Priority donut (live values only)
- pipeline card: Picked, 1st comment, Resolved (live counts)

Demo CSS is copied into app/trk-demo.css and scoped under .trk-demo, so other pages are not affected.
Icons: components/trk-icons.js (paths from the demo). Left out because live data is missing: last-week deltas, sparklines, Follow-up stage.
Unchanged: data fetch, filters, views, export, bulk KAM feedback, drawer, roles, board, pagination.
Counts for My escalations and Feedback failures use count-only requests (pageSize 1).
